  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 101.03 Terms used in Federal Provisions Adopted by Reference",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 101.03 Terms used in Federal Provisions Adopted by Reference. Where 40 CFR 141 provisions are referenced in subtitle Env-Dw, the terms used in such provisions shall be as defined in 40 CFR 141.2 unless specifically modified or otherwise defined.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
